  "title": "Lydia L NDE 3949",
  "date": "31 aout 2008",
  "content": "For two days I had had the same dream. A voice told me to visit my grandmother's gravestone. With a friend, I went to see it. When we found it, I had a feeling something bad was going to happen. I started home on my bicycle near 7:00 pm. I was not wearing my hard helmet with earphones. I was focusing on my premonition. At a red light, I crossed the street. I could see the car coming, and I thought it was going to stop to let me crossover. But it wasn't. It hardly slowed down, and then it swerved and hit me. In the space of five seconds, I saw my life passing before me, and my grandmother, who was near to me. When I opened my eyes, I was under my bike, unable to move. My elbow was covered in blood; my right leg, too. The bike was in a bad state as well. I went to hospital and the doctor told me I had no bones broken, but I had been very lucky that my head did not strike the front of the car, or even hit the ground.",
